      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HARA HACHI BU (1) is a talented dog who was well fancied as favourite latest and flew the lids, leading throughout and scoring (22.61) at Geelong in Grade 4/5 over 400m. Brilliant beginner who should be leading the way here. Winner at her latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Sure to prove hard to beat. DEVON DAISIES (3) has mixed form recently, finishing seventh (19.90) in a Grade 5 at Healesville latest but did run well two back when in the frame. Expecting significant improvement this line-up. SUBLIME (4) took the sit on the lead but levelled up to score (19.93) at this track in a Grade 5 over 350m. Ran the fastest time on the program in his latest win. One of the leading chances again. STILL A BELIEVER (2) should be thereabouts despite an unplaced run here most recently.",
